{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50839","headline":"耸翠峰题石（原注：峯在袁州府城西三十里。） · 卢肇","name":"耸翠峰题石（原注：峯在袁州府城西三十里。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耸翠峰高千百尺，四时常似莓蓝色。\n卓然万古镇祗园，世代鬼工驱不得。\n巍巍直上插青天，远疑似与天相连。\n韎临下视羣山小，千里平铺在眼（一作「目」）前。\n藤蔓交加生薜荔，土毛苍藓相蒙蔽。\n风翦云开雨歇时，飞出一山新翡翠。\n日回影倒落前溪，烟波湛湛浸琉璃。\n更将何物可比类，分明一只擎天柱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}